{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0000", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "证券期货法律适用意见第 19 号\n——《上市公司收购管理办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0001", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十三条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0002", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十四条的适用意见\n为了正确理解与适用《上市公司收购管理办法》（证监\n会令第 166 号，以下简称《收购办法》）", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0003", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十三条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0004", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十四条，\n我会制定《证券期货法律适用意见第 19 号——<上市公司收\n购管理办法>", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0005", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十三条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0006", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十四条的适用意见》，现予公布，\n请遵照执行。\n一、《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0007", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0008", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第一款“达到一个上市公司\n已发行股份的 5%时”是指触及一个上市公司已发行股份的\n5%时，如从 4%升至 5%、从 6%降至 5%。\n《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0009", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十四条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0010", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第一款“达到或者超过一个上市\n公司已发行股份的 5%时”是指触及或者跨越一个上市公司\n已发行股份的 5%时。\n二、《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0011", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0012", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第二款“占该上市公司已发\n行股份的比例每增加或者减少 5%”是指占该上市公司已发行\n股份的比例触及 5%的整数倍（不含 5%），如 10%、15%等。\n《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0013", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十四条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0014", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第二款“占该上市公司已发行股\n份的比例每增加或者减少达到或者超过 5%”是指占该上市\n公司已发行股份的比例触及或者跨越 5%的整数倍（不含 5%），\n如 10%、15%等。\n三、《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0015", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第十三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0016", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第三款“占该上市公司已发\n行股份的比例每增加或者减少 1%”是指占该上市公司已发\n1", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0017", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "行股份的比例触及 1%的整数倍时，如 6%、7%、8%等。\n四、因上市公司增发股份、减少股本、以及可转债持有\n人转股等上市公司股本变化导致投资者及其一致行动人拥\n有权益的股份比例触及或者跨越 5%及 5%的整数倍，或者导\n致持股 5%以上的投资者及其一致行动人拥有权益的股份比\n例触及 1%的整数倍的，投资者及其一致行动人无需履行报\n告、公告和限售义务。上市公司应当自完成股本变更登记之\n日起规定时间内，就因此导致的投资者及其一致行动人拥有\n权益的股份发生前述变动情况作出公告；因公司减少股本可\n能导致投资者及其一致行动人成为公司第一大股东或者实\n际控制人的，该投资者及其一致行动人应当按照《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0018", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十九条履行报告、公告义务。\n五、《收购办法》", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0019", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十三条、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0020", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十四条中的时间指交易\n日。其中，", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0021", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0022", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第一款和", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0023", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十四条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0024", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第一款的“事实发生\n之日起 3 日内”中 3 日的起算日为事实发生当日；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0025", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0026", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第一款的“在上述期限内”是指该事实发生之日起至公告\n日，含事实发生之日和公告日当日；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0027", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第十三条", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0040_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0040_att1::c0028", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第二款的“事\n实发生之日起至公告后 3 日内”含事实发生当日，3 日的起\n算日为公告日的次一交易日。\n六、本规定自发布之日起实施。本规定发布之前实施的\n股票交易行为适用 2020 年 7 月 31 日发布的《监管规则适用\n指引——上市类第 1 号》，但依据本规定认定违法程度较轻\n或者不认为是违法的，适用本规定。\n2", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
